{
  "description": "SLADE one-at-a-time sweep around the tuned configuration of whichever study is replayed (any loss, any dataset); every other parameter keeps its tuned value. Six live SLADE settings: eta (regularizer_target_ratio, extended below the Phase 1 bound 0.5 as for LRML, and up to the max-ratio cap 3), basis_target_ratio (L_Basis strength), cluster_ratio (k-means k over the labeled class count; k is clamped to the unlabeled pool), update_interval_epochs (re-clustering interval; 100 and 500 re-cluster only in runs that last that long past the warm-up), unlabeled_batch_size (wins over unlabeled_ratio) and sd_margin (Eq 5 margin). A value that equals a study's tuned value replays that study's baseline. 1000 epochs as a ceiling, patience 20.",
